<title>JAPAN: Akebono to issue 10 bln yen convertible.</title>
<headline>Akebono to issue 10 bln yen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Akebono Brake Industry</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Fuji Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   2     AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.95%(tentatively) ISSU PRICE PAR   MATURITY 30.Sep.05</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CONV FROM 1.Nov.96    CONV TO 29.Sep.05</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 13.Sep.96    INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE		 SUB DATE 6-12 Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI		 LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on September 5.</p>
</text>
